






@(1 = 1-8) Say to my lord, and repeat to my kid of the mountains, with beautiful horns; to my horse of the mountains, with an eagle's claws; my date-palm, growing on untouched ground and with fresh (?) dates hanging from it: this is what the captain of pledged  @varh[t3121.v1]{troops } @vart[t3121.v2,t3121.v1]{@varn{2 mss. have instead:} soldiers }, @wPN{Aba-indasa} -- who, by means of prayers for his king, greatly pleases his king's heart -- your servant, says:

#etcsl#altGrpo
#etcsl#alt t3121.v1 t3121.v2
#etcsl#altGrpc

@(9 = 9-10) You are mighty,  @varh[t3121.v3]{my lord; I will follow you } @vart[t3121.v4,t3121.v3]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} let me be your soldier }!  @varh[t3121.v5]{Let me be the courier of your business } @vart[t3121.v6,t3121.v5]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} I will stand (?) before him attentively }!

