@(11 = 11-13) When a boat is available, I will steer (?) with the rudder;  @varh[t3121.v7]{when water is available } @vart[t3121.v8,t3121.v7]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} when a father is available }, I will plunge in;  @vart[t3121.v9,t3121.v9]{@varn{2 mss. add:} when a son is available, I will thresh (?); }  @vart[t3121.v10,t3121.v10]{@varn{1 ms. adds:} …… I will make …… shiny; } when wind is available,  @varh[t3121.v11]{I will winnow } @vart[t3121.v12,t3121.v11]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} I will …… }.

